    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How much is the Strawberry Cheesequake Blizzard?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">For 2026, the Strawberry Cheesequake Blizzard averages $3.99 for Mini, $4.79 for Small, $5.79 for Medium, and $6.49 for Large at most participating Dairy Queen locations nationwide.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is in the Strawberry Cheesequake Blizzard?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Real baked cheesecake pieces, sweet strawberry fruit topping, and crumbly buttery pie crust blended directly into signature Dairy Queen vanilla soft serve.</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How does it compare to the Royal New York Cheesecake Blizzard?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Both use real cheesecake pieces. However, the Royal New York Cheesecake features graham cracker crust and a thick strawberry topping poured straight down a hollowed center core, whereas the Cheesequake blends strawberry glaze and pie crust pieces uniformly throughout the entire soft serve cup.</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

